# Engineering notes — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

The durable **"why"** record for the whole project: decisions that outlive any one campaign — data conventions,
shared-artifact choices, tooling / environment calls, cross-campaign methodology. Losing this rationale on a
copy or fork is what causes work to be repeated; keep it here so it survives. (Campaign-specific tuning
decisions may stay inline in that campaign's `campaign.md`.)

Each entry: the decision, the alternatives, why this one, the conditions it rests on, and what would make you
revisit it (mirrors the `record-decision` skill). Append-only.

